1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,456
Mr. Park: Zombies are slow. I will stroll
to the pharmacy.

2
00:00:03,776 --> 00:00:08,865
BUS-E: Ding dong! This is the Last Bus,
Route twelve. Part four of ten: the slow ones.

3
00:00:09,185 --> 00:00:14,662
Priya: Mr. Park. Movie zombies walk. Real
hunger runs.

4
00:00:14,982 --> 00:00:17,005
Mr. Park: It's nine feet away. I'll be
quick.

5
00:00:17,125 --> 00:00:21,456
Priya: Nine feet is two seconds. If they
run.

6
00:00:21,776 --> 00:00:23,270
Dante: ...I'll let him stretch first.

7
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:29,375
Rosa: Elm Street. Pharmacy. One zombie,
watching us.

8
00:00:29,695 --> 00:00:31,538
Dante: Go, Mr. Park. Stroll!

9
00:00:31,658 --> 00:00:34,301
Mr. Park: Strolling. Strolling. Strol...

10
00:00:34,621 --> 00:00:36,606
Mr. Park: It's running! Why is it
running?!

11
00:00:36,726 --> 00:00:37,978
Dante: That was not in the movie.

12
00:00:38,298 --> 00:00:39,802
Teddy: Gary says never race a hungry
person.

13
00:00:40,122 --> 00:00:44,280
Priya: Real rule. Never assume they're
slow. Keep your distance.

14
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:47,310
Steve: Excuse me. Am I fast enough?

15
00:00:47,430 --> 00:00:49,504
Rosa: You are a polite speed, Steve.

16
00:00:49,824 --> 00:00:51,472
Mr. Park: My insulin and I are fine.

17
00:00:51,792 --> 00:00:52,951
Amara: My baby clapped.

18
00:00:53,392 --> 00:00:58,074
BUS-E: Ticket scan complete. Steve's
ticket is valid for Route twelve. Cozy!

19
00:00:58,394 --> 00:01:04,464
BUS-E: Part four of ten, the Last Bus,
Route twelve. Next: the sofa. Follow for part five.

